  <MiliraXian.Characters.Common.PerkSystem.CharacterPerkNodeDef Class="MiliraXian.Characters.Neiyu.Cultivation.NeiyuCultivationNodeDef">
    <defName>MX_Neiyu_Cultivation_Weapon1</defName><label>初醒</label>
    <category>MX_Neiyu_Cultivation_Weapons</category><rank>1</rank><displayOrder>1</displayOrder><iconActive>MiliraXianNeiyu/UI/Cultivation/Wing</iconActive>
    <description>提高花、剑与弓的普通攻击伤害和穿透，缩短剑形攻击间隔，并增加普攻碎矢。</description>
    <story>残魂逐渐被唤醒，肉身在长时间的凝练中塑炼出来。初醒的霓羽迷茫中握住了在身旁的一枝霓裳花，粉色的花瓣接触的第一时刻她逐渐清楚了自己要做的事情。要做的事情，还有很多。</story>
    <costs><Milira_Feather>6</Milira_Feather><Steel>60</Steel></costs>
    <equipmentEffects><li><equipment>MX_Neiyu_Form_Weapon</equipment><meleeDamage>4</meleeDamage><meleePenetration>0.12</meleePenetration><statOffsets><MeleeWeapon_CooldownMultiplier>-0.06</MeleeWeapon_CooldownMultiplier></statOffsets></li><li><equipment>MX_Neiyu_Form_Flower</equipment><meleeDamage>0.8</meleeDamage><meleePenetration>0.02</meleePenetration></li><li><equipment>MX_Neiyu_Form_Bow</equipment><projectileDamage>0</projectileDamage><projectilePenetration>0.04</projectilePenetration><splitCount>1</splitCount></li></equipmentEffects>
  </MiliraXian.Characters.Common.PerkSystem.CharacterPerkNodeDef>
  <MiliraXian.Characters.Common.PerkSystem.CharacterPerkNodeDef Class="MiliraXian.Characters.Neiyu.Cultivation.NeiyuCultivationNodeDef">
    <defName>MX_Neiyu_Cultivation_Apparel1</defName><label>衣上微纹</label>
    <category>MX_Neiyu_Cultivation_Apparel</category><rank>1</rank><displayOrder>1</displayOrder><iconActive>MiliraXianNeiyu/UI/Cultivation/Law</iconActive>
    <description>提高常规衣物的防护，增强穿戴时候的移动速度、闪避概率、承伤系数与攻击间隔的数值。</description>
    <story>找回了一部分关于【法纹】的记忆，霓羽成功在自己凝练的衣物上面刻画增强防护力的法纹。【法纹】的力量多种多样，呈现的效果大多取决于施法者的想象力。“一切皆有可能。”</story>
    <costs><Milira_Feather>6</Milira_Feather><Cloth>60</Cloth></costs>
    <equipmentEffects><li><equipment>MiliraXian_NeiyuNormal</equipment><statOffsets><ArmorRating_Sharp>0.18</ArmorRating_Sharp><ArmorRating_Blunt>0.17</ArmorRating_Blunt><ArmorRating_Heat>0.18</ArmorRating_Heat></statOffsets><equippedStatOffsets><MoveSpeed>0.2</MoveSpeed><MeleeDodgeChance>2.4</MeleeDodgeChance><IncomingDamageFactor>-0.018</IncomingDamageFactor></equippedStatOffsets></li><li><equipment>MiliraXian_NeiyuInner</equipment><statOffsets><ArmorRating_Sharp>0.09</ArmorRating_Sharp><ArmorRating_Blunt>0.08</ArmorRating_Blunt><ArmorRating_Heat>0.12</ArmorRating_Heat></statOffsets><equippedStatOffsets><IncomingDamageFactor>-0.012</IncomingDamageFactor><MeleeCooldownFactor>-0.012</MeleeCooldownFactor></equippedStatOffsets></li><li><equipment>MX_Apparel_EarringsZhenzhu</equipment><statOffsets><ArmorRating_Sharp>0.14</ArmorRating_Sharp><ArmorRating_Blunt>0.13</ArmorRating_Blunt><ArmorRating_Heat>0.15</ArmorRating_Heat></statOffsets><equippedStatOffsets><AimingDelayFactor>-0.02</AimingDelayFactor><RangedCooldownFactor>-0.02</RangedCooldownFactor></equippedStatOffsets></li></equipmentEffects>
  </MiliraXian.Characters.Common.PerkSystem.CharacterPerkNodeDef>
  <MiliraXian.Characters.Common.PerkSystem.CharacterPerkNodeDef Class="MiliraXian.Characters.Neiyu.Cultivation.NeiyuCultivationNodeDef">
    <defName>MX_Neiyu_Cultivation_Halo1</defName><label>微环</label>
    <category>MX_Neiyu_Cultivation_Halo</category><rank>1</rank><displayOrder>1</displayOrder><iconActive>MiliraXianNeiyu/UI/Cultivation/Halo</iconActive>
    <description>对霓羽的护身层数上限提升至42层。</description>
    <story>逐渐良好的身体状态让霓羽可以渐渐的塑炼自己的光环，她用花瓣粉饰自己的光环，自身的护身力量来自自己的光环，光环的力量得到增强对于霓羽的反馈便是更加坚硬的护身力量。</story>
    <costs><Milira_Feather>6</Milira_Feather><Jade>12</Jade></costs>
    <shieldCharges>18</shieldCharges>
  </MiliraXian.Characters.Common.PerkSystem.CharacterPerkNodeDef>
